    "title": "Torrington Girls and Boys Earn Wins in First Conference Games of the Season - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago Burns, WY January 20th, 2026 — The Torrington Trailblazers are undefeated in conference play after a couple of wins on the hard court this past Friday in Burns. The Lady Blazers defeated the Lady Broncs, 48-28. Senior, Natalie Long led the Blazers with 28 points, including a three-pointer. Esperanza Chavez provided a spark off of the bench, hitting a three on her way to 6 points. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
